{"type":"standard","title":"Andy Harris (politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Andy Harris (politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q506639","titles":{"canonical":"Andy_Harris_(politician)","normalized":"Andy Harris (politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Andy Harris (politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":9338058,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Andy_Harris_115th_Congress_Higher_dif_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Andy_Harris_115th_Congress_Higher_dif_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/Andy_Harris_115th_Congress_Higher_dif_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":872,"height":1090},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1381317657","tid":"63ce04b9-cd66-11f1-90c9-0d3b3c6347d8","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:45:07Z","description":"American politician (born 1957)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andy_Harris_(politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andy_Harris_(politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andy_Harris_(politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Andy_Harris_(politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andy_Harris_(politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Andy_Harris_(politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andy_Harris_(politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Andy_Harris_(politician)"}},"extract":"Andrew Peter Harris is an American politician and physician who has served since 2011 as the U.S. representative for Maryland's 1st congressional district. A member of the Republican Party, Harris was previously a member of the Maryland Senate from 1999 until 2011.","extract_html":"<p><b>Andrew Peter Harris</b> is an American politician and physician who has served since 2011 as the U.S. representative for Maryland's 1st congressional district. A member of the Republican Party, Harris was previously a member of the Maryland Senate from 1999 until 2011.</p>"}